  "question": {
    "text": "The solution of the differential equation <math><mfrac><mrow><mi>d</mi><mi>y</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mi>y</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn><mi>y</mi></mrow></mfrac></math> is (where,&nbsp;<math><mi>c</mi></math> is an arbitrary constant)",
